\n\
*cracks knuckles*\n\
\n\
But first... the SPIDER requires {1}{G}! Let us see... my Swamp provides the LIFE, my Forest provides the NATURE, and together they shall SUMMON this eight-legged menace!\n\
\n\
*taps Swamp then Forest with flourish*\n\
\n\
With mana secured, I CAST the Aquastrand Spider! \n\
\n\
*confirms the play*\n\
\n\
\n\
