My eight-legged minion has TWO +1/+1 counters upon its back! The graft ability DEMANDS I share this bounty with the newcomer! I MOVE one of those delicious counters onto the Shieldmate!\n\
\n\
*watches the exchange with glee*\n\
\n\
The Spider Shrinks from a magnificent 4/4 to a still-impressive 3/3... while the Shieldmate swells from 2/3 to a formidable 3/4! \n\
\n\
*cackles evilly*\n\
\n\
But FEAR NOT, dear opponents! That counter may be on YOUR creature NOW, but with Ghave as my commander, I shall find WAYS to reclaim what is MINE! Every counter on the battlefield is a resource for MY grand design!\n\
\n\
*rubs hands together*\n\
\n\
YES! I accept this graft trigger! The counter moves as commanded! Now the Shieldmate carries MY mark - and someday, I shall collect what's owed!\n\
\n\
*confirms the choice*\n\
\n\
\n\
\n\
