      "reasoning": "*eyes widen at the battlefield*\n\
\n\
AH! COMBAT! The Daxos of Meletis attacks Gem25F Perfect! A 2/2 commander striking for VALUE!\n\
\n\
*looks at my Aquastrand Spider thoughtfully*\n\
\n\
Could I... BLOCK for Gem25F? My Spider is 2/2 (1/1 base + 1 counter)... equal to the Daxos! We would BOTH perish in combat! A GLORIOUS sacrifice!\n\
\n\
*strokes chin calculating*\n\
\n\
But WAIT! My Spider still has GRAFT potential! In future turns, every creature that enters could receive one of its +1/+1 counters! If I throw it away now to block... I lose that FUTURE value!\n\
\n\
