\n\
Besides! The Spider has summoning sickness! ...Wait, no, blocking doesn't require untapped! A creature can block even with summoning sickness!\n\
\n\
*thinks harder*\n\
\n\
But still! The exchange is EQUAL - 2 damage for 2 damage! My Spider dies, Daxos dies! Neither player gains advantage! It's a WASH!\n\
\n\
*crosses arms*\n\
\n\
I PASS! Let Gem25F Perfect defend themselves! Let o3 Sarge's attack resolve! My Spider is too VALUABLE as a FUTURE asset to throw away in an equal trade!\n\
\n\
*rubs hands villainously*\n\
\n\
The Spider lives to graft another day! MY plan continues!\n\
