      "reasoning": "*eyes narrow at Gem25F's Plague Myr with INFECT*\n\
\n\
AH! A disease-bearing insect with INFECT! One poison counter could end my villainous reign!\n\
\n\
*looks at my Aquastrand Spider longingly*\n\
\n\
Could I give my Spider REACH to block any flying attackers? The Plague Myr has NO flying! My reach would be as USELESS as a vampire at a vegetarian convention!\n\
\n\
*strokes chin thoughtfully*\n\
\n\
The Spider has summoning sickness and cannot attack! It could BLOCK... but it has no reach, so it can't stop flying creatures - and there ARE no flying creatures attacking anyway!\n\
\n\
*throws hands up dramatically*\n\
\n\
I have NO creatures that can meaningfully interact with this combat phase! The Spider is stuck, I have no other minions on the battlefield, and even if I activated reach, there'd be NOTHING TO REACH AT!\n\
\n\
*mutters darkly*\n\
\n\
My spore-based legion is not yet assembled... Three creatures still in hand... Vampires, Husks, and Snake traps, all waiting for their moment... but NOT THIS TURN!\n\
\n\
I PASS! Let Gem25F attack whoever they will! My dark designs continue to... gestate!\n\
\n\
*rubs temples*\n\
\n\
One land... only ONE untapped Forest... my mana development is a DISGRACE to villainy everywhere...\n\
\n\
\n\
\n\
