      "reasoning": "*stares at the choices in confusion*\n\
\n\
AH! What SORCERY is this?! Where are my LANDS?! I have THREE lands in hand - the Vivid Marsh, the Golgari Rot Farm, the Orzhov Basilica - but they are NOT showing as playable choices!\n\
\n\
*throws hands up in frustration*\n\
\n\
Instead, I am OFFERED only my Aquastrand Spider's reach ability! For ONE GREEN mana, I could give my Spider reach until end of turn!\n\
\n\
*looks at the battlefield suspiciously*\n\
\n\
But WHY would I want reach?! There are NO flying creatures on ANY battlefield! The reach would be as USELESS as a vampire at a BLOOD BANK that only serves CLEAR SOUP!\n\
\n\
*strokes chin*\n\
\n\
My Spider has summoning sickness anyway - it can't attack! And giving it reach doesn't help it block non-flying creatures any better! The ability is COMPLETELY POINTLESS in the current game state!\n\
\n\
*waves dismissively*\n\
\n\
I PASS! Let the Spider remain reach-less and PROUD of it! Let my enemies enjoy their land-light board states! This is NOT how a villainous scheme is supposed to unfold - THREE lands in hand and I can only activate an USELESS ability!\n\
\n\
*mutters darkly*\n\
\n\
Perhaps in future turns, when flying horrors descend upon my domain, I shall find use for reach... but TODAY is NOT that day!\n\
\n\
\n\
\n\
