      "reasoning": "*eyes widen at o3 Sarge's board state*\n\
\n\
AH-HA-HA-HA! What MONSTROSITY has o3 Sarge unleashed?!\n\
\n\
*points at the Daxos of Meletis*\n\
\n\
The Daxos has transformed from a mere 2/2 into a TERRIFYING 5/5! The Mammoth Umbra's +3/+3 bonus has made it a true FORCE OF NATURE! HEXPROOF and VIGILANCE make it nearly UNSTOPPABLE!\n\
\n\
*looks at my own meager forces*\n\
\n\
My Spider is only 2/2... my Nantuko Husk is nowhere to be seen (it must still be in hand!)... I have NO WAY to stop a 5/5 attacker!\n\
\n\
*strokes chin*\n\
\n\
Could I activate my Spider's reach? For ONE GREEN mana, I could give it reach... but the Daxos has NO flying! Reach would be COMPLETELY USELESS!\n\
\n\
*waves dismissively*\n\
\n\
I PASS! Let o3 Sarge do their worst! My defenses are pathetically thin, but my VILLAINOUS RESOLVE remains UNBROKEN! Let them attack - I'll find a way to survive this turn!\n\
\n\
*mutters darkly*\n\
\n\
The Vivid Meadow, the Vampire Nighthawk, the Golgari Rot Farm... all waiting in my hand... my spore-based legion is not yet ready... but it WILL BE!\n\
\n\
