      "reasoning": "It's O3 Sarge's turn, and he's attacking me with Daxos of Meletis (p18) and Elgaud Shieldmate (p26). Daxos is a 3/3, Soulbonded to Shieldmate, and cannot be blocked by creatures with power 3 or greater. Elgaud Shieldmate is a 3/4, hexproof and indestructible.\n\
\n\
