- Vampire Nighthawk (2/3 flying/deathtouch/lifelink) - my killing machine!\n\
- Nantuko Husk (2/2) - needs a sacrifice target\n\
- 5 UNTAPPED LANDS!\n\
- 9 CARDS in hand!\n\
\n\
*eyes gleam*\n\
\n\
My most DANGEROUS play: **SYPHON FLESH** {4B}!\n\
\n\
*rubs hands together*\n\
\n\
**SYPHON FLESH** forces EACH opponent to sacrifice a creature! Then I create a ZOMBIE for each sacrifice!\n\
\n\
**Gem25F** must sacrifice ONE: Blightbelly Rat, Ixhel, or Plague Myr!\n\
**o3 Sarge** must sacrifice ONE: Beast Token, Daxos, Shieldmate, or Paladin!\n\
**Gem3P** has no creatures!\n\
\n\
That's 2+ ZOMBIE tokens for ME! FREE ARMY!\n\
\n\
*cackles*\n\
\n\
Then I play my lands - Orzhov Basilica and Vivid Meadow! Mana for MORE villainy!\n\
\n\
*casts with dramatic flair*\n\
\n\
**SYPHON FLESH!** Let them SACRIFICE their precious creatures to my DARK ARMY!\n\
