\n\
1.  **Glissa's Retriever (p22) attacks MiniMx Villain (p35).** Glissa's Retriever is a 6/6 Haste with Toxic 3. MiniMx Villain is at 5 poison. This attack could push them to 8 poison. Their Vampire Nighthawk is a potential blocker, but blocking with it would be a losing trade for them, as they would lose their Nighthawk to prevent just one combat damage and 3 poison, and it doesn't even have toxic. Glissa's Retriever cannot be blocked by their Nantuko Husk or Zombie Tokens due to its ability. I anticipate this attack will go unblocked, potentially leading to a massive jump in poison counters.\n\
