3.  **Ixhel, Scion of Atraxa (p2) will not attack.** O3 Sarge's Daxos and Elgaud Shieldmate pose too great a threat, and I cannot afford to lose my commander.\n\
\n\
I will declare Glissa's Retriever (p22) and Plague Myr (p4) as attackers.",
