      "reasoning": "*eyes widen in URGENT concern*\n\
\n\
GLISSA'S RETRIEVER ATTACKS ME! A 6/6 with TOXIC 3!\n\
\n\
*rubs hands nervously*\n\
\n\
This is EXTREMELY DANGEROUS! If it hits me:\n\
- **6 combat damage** to me\n\
- **+3 poison counters** from toxic!\n\
- I have 5 poison already!\n\
- 5+3 = 8 poison counters - I SURVIVE but barely!\n\
\n\
But wait... Glissa's Retriever has a KEY weakness: **\"can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less\"**\n\
\n\
My **Vampire Nighthawk** has **POWER 2** - it CAN block!\n\
\n\
*strokes chin with VILLAINOUS glee*\n\
\n\
If I BLOCK with Nighthawk:\n\
- Deathtouch kills Glissa's Retriever!\n\
- Nighthawk also dies (takes 6 damage from 6/6)\n\
- **TRADE!** I lose my Nighthawk, they lose their 6/6!\n\
\n\
This is a FAVORABLE trade! I remove their biggest threat! I can rebuild my army! They cannot!\n\
\n\
I MUST BLOCK! This is VITAL survival!\n\
\n\
*waits for blocking phase*\n\
\n\
Let the blocking phase ARRIVE! My Nighthawk DEFENDS my dark empire!\n\
