      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "*stretches arms with EVIL ANTICIPATION*\n\
\n\
MY TURN! Finally! The stage is set for my grand design!\n\
\n\
*rubs hands together*\n\
\n\
First, I shall establish my dark infrastructure! Vivid Meadow joins my domain - its shimmering pools of mana shall fuel my nefarious schemes!\n\
\n\
*plays Vivid Meadow*\n\
\n\
Now, my Vampire Nighthawk shall be fitted with the legendary Skullclamp! Though it reduces his might, his DEATH will grant me TWO fresh cards of knowledge!\n\
\n\
*casts Skullclamp, targeting Vampire Nighthawk*\n\
\n\
HA HA HA! What? You thought that puny -1 would stop my flying terror? He still has FLIGHT! DEATHTOUCH! And LIFELINK! Now when he falls in battle, I shall harvest the wisdom of my fallen enemies!\n\
\n\
*strokes chin dramatically*\n\
\n\
And now... the arrival of Yavimaya Elder! A creature of great wisdom - even if destroyed, he shall reveal TWO secrets from the aether!\n\
\n\
*casts Yavimaya Elder*\n\
\n\
And one final land for my collection! Orzhov Basilica - the seat of my power!\n\
