      "reasoning": "*LAUGHS MANIACALLY*\n\
\n\
YES! YES! My assault was RESOUNDINGLY successful!\n\
\n\
*rubs hands with EVIL SATISFACTION*\n\
\n\
Gem3P Hype CRUMBLES! 9 damage from my glorious minions! They now stand at a FRAGILE 11 life! And I? I have GROWN STRONGER! From 37 to 40 life - the power of my Vampire Nighthawk's lifelink fills my veins with DARK ENERGY!\n\
\n\
*strokes chin thoughtfully*\n\
\n\
Now, in the aftermath of my triumph... I have limited options. My Nantuko Husk hungers for sacrifice, but all my creatures are tapped from glorious battle! And Soul Snare waits for prey that no longer attacks...\n\
\n\
*waves hand dismissively*\n\
\n\
