      "reasoning": "*LEAPS UP WITH TRIUMPHANT CACKLING*\n\
\n\
GEM3P HYPE HAS FALLEN! ELIMINATED BY MY DARKNESS! HA HA HA HA!\n\
\n\
*rubs hands together with EVIL SATISFACTION*\n\
\n\
Now to face o3 Sarge alone! Their Daxos has grown to a TERRIFYING 9/9 with hexproof and indestructible! But they underestimate my cunning!\n\
\n\
*strokes chin thoughtfully*\n\
\n\
First, I shall establish more of my dark infrastructure! Orzhov Basilica joins my domain!\n\
\n\
*plays Orzhov Basilica*\n\
\n\
Now, Yavimaya Elder shall activate his power! Sacrifice himself to draw a card! His wisdom will serve my master plan even in death!\n\
\n\
*activates Yavimaya Elder*\n\
\n\
The Skullclamp... hmm. I could equip it to a fresh creature, but my Vampire Nighthawk wears it in glory! And my tokens would be SACRIFICED for mere cards... a waste of my dark forces!\n\
\n\
*waves dismissively*\n\
\n\
Let o3 Sarge tremble in fear! Let them think they've won! The war is not over... it has only JUST BEGUN!\n\
\n\
*passes with VILLAINOUS CONFIDENCE*",
